  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;are terms of an&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>,&nbsp;</p><p>So common difference will be,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math></p><p>Now solving,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><msqrt><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><msqrt><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><msqrt><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now using the formula&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>0</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
